{"id":"the-man-from-snowy-river","title":"The Man from Snowy River","author":"A. B. Paterson","year":"1895","note":"Paterson’s legendary ride down the mountain after a prize colt — bush epic in verse.","minutes":361,"cover":"","coverAlt":"","scenes":[{"id":"s0","title":"Chapter 1","place":"Chapter 1","reentry":"Prelude","prompt":"What does the poem hold?"},{"id":"s1","title":"Chapter 2","place":"Chapter 2","reentry":"Saltbush Bill","prompt":"What does the poem hold?"},{"id":"s2","title":"Chapter 3","place":"Chapter 3","reentry":"Black Swans","prompt":"What does the poem hold?"}],"breaths":[{"id":"s0-0","sceneId":"s0","text":"Prelude"},{"id":"s0-1","sceneId":"s0","text":"I have gathered these stories afar,"},{"id":"s0-2","sceneId":"s0","text":"In the wind and the rain,"},{"id":"s0-3","sceneId":"s0","text":"In the land where the cattle camps are,"},{"id":"s0-4","sceneId":"s0","text":"On the edge of the plain."},{"id":"s0-5","sceneId":"s0","text":"On the overland routes of the west,"},{"id":"s0-6","sceneId":"s0","text":"When the watches were long,"},{"id":"s0-7","sceneId":"s0","text":"I have fashioned in earnest and jest"},{"id":"s0-8","sceneId":"s0","text":"These fragments of song."},{"id":"s0-9","sceneId":"s0","text":"They are just the rude stories one hears"},{"id":"s0-10","sceneId":"s0","text":"In sadness and mirth,"},{"id":"s0-11","sceneId":"s0","text":"The records of wandering years,"},{"id":"s0-12","sceneId":"s0","text":"And scant is their worth"},{"id":"s0-13","sceneId":"s0","text":"Though their merits indeed are but slight,"},{"id":"s0-14","sceneId":"s0","text":"I shall not repine,"},{"id":"s0-15","sceneId":"s0","text":"If they give you one moment's delight,"},{"id":"s0-16","sceneId":"s0","text":"Old comrades of mine."},{"id":"s0-17","sceneId":"s0","text":"Contents with First Lines:"},{"id":"s0-18","sceneId":"s0","text":"Prelude"},{"id":"s0-19","sceneId":"s0","text":"I have gathered these stories afar,"},{"id":"s0-20","sceneId":"s0","text":"The Man from Snowy River"},{"id":"s0-21","sceneId":"s0","text":"There was movement at the station, for the word had passed around"},{"id":"s0-22","sceneId":"s0","text":"Old Pardon, the Son of Reprieve"},{"id":"s0-23","sceneId":"s0","text":"You never heard tell of the story?"},{"id":"s0-24","sceneId":"s0","text":"Clancy of the Overflow"},{"id":"s0-25","sceneId":"s0","text":"I had written him a letter which I had, for want of better"},{"id":"s0-26","sceneId":"s0","text":"Conroy's Gap"},{"id":"s0-27","sceneId":"s0","text":"This was the way of it, don't you know --"},{"id":"s0-28","sceneId":"s0","text":"Our New Horse"},{"id":"s0-29","sceneId":"s0","text":"The boys had come back from the races"},{"id":"s0-30","sceneId":"s0","text":"An Idyll of Dandaloo"},{"id":"s0-31","sceneId":"s0","text":"On Western plains, where shade is not,"},{"id":"s0-32","sceneId":"s0","text":"The Geebung Polo Club"},{"id":"s0-33","sceneId":"s0","text":"It was somewhere up the country, in a land of rock and scrub,"},{"id":"s0-34","sceneId":"s0","text":"The Travelling Post Office"},{"id":"s0-35","sceneId":"s0","text":"The roving breezes come and go, the reed beds sweep and sway,"},{"id":"s1-0","sceneId":"s1","text":"Saltbush Bill"},{"id":"s1-1","sceneId":"s1","text":"Now this is the law of the Overland that all in the West obey,"},{"id":"s1-2","sceneId":"s1","text":"A Mountain Station"},{"id":"s1-3","sceneId":"s1","text":"I bought a run a while ago,"},{"id":"s1-4","sceneId":"s1","text":"Been There Before"},{"id":"s1-5","sceneId":"s1","text":"There came a stranger to Walgett town,"},{"id":"s1-6","sceneId":"s1","text":"The Man Who Was Away"},{"id":"s1-7","sceneId":"s1","text":"The widow sought the lawyer's room with children three in tow,"},{"id":"s1-8","sceneId":"s1","text":"The Man from Ironbark"},{"id":"s1-9","sceneId":"s1","text":"It was the man from Ironbark who struck the Sydney town,"},{"id":"s1-10","sceneId":"s1","text":"The Open Steeplechase"},{"id":"s1-11","sceneId":"s1","text":"I had ridden over hurdles up the country once or twice,"},{"id":"s1-12","sceneId":"s1","text":"The Amateur Rider"},{"id":"s1-13","sceneId":"s1","text":"_HIM_ going to ride for us!  _HIM_ --"},{"id":"s1-14","sceneId":"s1","text":"with the pants and the eyeglass and all."},{"id":"s1-15","sceneId":"s1","text":"On Kiley's Run"},{"id":"s1-16","sceneId":"s1","text":"The roving breezes come and go"},{"id":"s1-17","sceneId":"s1","text":"Frying Pan's Theology"},{"id":"s1-18","sceneId":"s1","text":"Scene:  On Monaro."},{"id":"s1-19","sceneId":"s1","text":"The Two Devines"},{"id":"s1-20","sceneId":"s1","text":"It was shearing-time at the Myall Lake,"},{"id":"s1-21","sceneId":"s1","text":"In the Droving Days"},{"id":"s1-22","sceneId":"s1","text":"'Only a pound,' said the auctioneer,"},{"id":"s1-23","sceneId":"s1","text":"Lost"},{"id":"s1-24","sceneId":"s1","text":"'He ought to be home,' said the old man,"},{"id":"s1-25","sceneId":"s1","text":"'without there's something amiss."},{"id":"s1-26","sceneId":"s1","text":"Over the Range"},{"id":"s1-27","sceneId":"s1","text":"Little bush maiden, wondering-eyed,"},{"id":"s1-28","sceneId":"s1","text":"Only a Jockey"},{"id":"s1-29","sceneId":"s1","text":"Out in the grey cheerless chill of the morning light,"},{"id":"s1-30","sceneId":"s1","text":"How M'Ginnis Went Missing"},{"id":"s1-31","sceneId":"s1","text":"Let us cease our idle chatter,"},{"id":"s1-32","sceneId":"s1","text":"A Voice from the Town"},{"id":"s1-33","sceneId":"s1","text":"I thought, in the days of the droving,"},{"id":"s1-34","sceneId":"s1","text":"A Bunch of Roses"},{"id":"s1-35","sceneId":"s1","text":"Roses ruddy and roses white,"},{"id":"s2-0","sceneId":"s2","text":"Black Swans"},{"id":"s2-1","sceneId":"s2","text":"As I lie at rest on a patch of clover"},{"id":"s2-2","sceneId":"s2","text":"The All Right 'Un"},{"id":"s2-3","sceneId":"s2","text":"He came from 'further out',"},{"id":"s2-4","sceneId":"s2","text":"The Boss of the 'Admiral Lynch'"},{"id":"s2-5","sceneId":"s2","text":"Did you ever hear tell of Chili?  I was readin' the other day"},{"id":"s2-6","sceneId":"s2","text":"A Bushman's Song"},{"id":"s2-7","sceneId":"s2","text":"I'm travellin' down the Castlereagh, and I'm a station hand,"},{"id":"s2-8","sceneId":"s2","text":"How Gilbert Died"},{"id":"s2-9","sceneId":"s2","text":"There's never a stone at the sleeper's head,"},{"id":"s2-10","sceneId":"s2","text":"The Flying Gang"},{"id":"s2-11","sceneId":"s2","text":"I served my time, in the days gone by,"},{"id":"s2-12","sceneId":"s2","text":"Shearing at Castlereagh"},{"id":"s2-13","sceneId":"s2","text":"The bell is set a-ringing, and the engine gives a toot,"},{"id":"s2-14","sceneId":"s2","text":"The Wind's Message"},{"id":"s2-15","sceneId":"s2","text":"There came a whisper down the Bland between the dawn and dark,"},{"id":"s2-16","sceneId":"s2","text":"Johnson's Antidote"},{"id":"s2-17","sceneId":"s2","text":"Down along the Snakebite River, where the overlanders camp,"},{"id":"s2-18","sceneId":"s2","text":"Ambition and Art"},{"id":"s2-19","sceneId":"s2","text":"I am the maid of the lustrous eyes"},{"id":"s2-20","sceneId":"s2","text":"The Daylight is Dying"},{"id":"s2-21","sceneId":"s2","text":"The daylight is dying"},{"id":"s2-22","sceneId":"s2","text":"In Defence of the Bush"},{"id":"s2-23","sceneId":"s2","text":"So you're back from up the country, Mister Townsman, where you went,"}]}